        <activityName xml:lang="en">Bus stop, AC binder layer, 15% recycling</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Bus stop, AC binder layer, 15% recycling
Modern Swiss and European technologies are applied to regional storage facilities, material extraction, and production processes. 
UUID: 27b1d296-550e-4773-81ef-f48a0a419c19
This dataset documents the production, installation, deconstruction and end-of-life treatment of 1 m2 AC binder layer for a bus stop (asphalt pavement) in Switzerland.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: Layer thickness 80 mm, service life 20 years. 15 % recycling content
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_27b1d296-550e-4773-81ef-f48a0a419c19.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
